  "conclusion": "No dynamic allocation strategy passes all criteria (Sharpe improvement + 4/5 cross-OOS + Harvey t>3.0). Best candidate: inv_vol (Sharpe 0.994 vs benchmark 0.932). Static 50/50 + 12/VIX remains the optimal retail strategy. The lack of improvement is consistent with DCC-GARCH finding that 2-asset RP weights are independent of correlation \u2014 the diversification benefit from 50/50 is already near-optimal analytically.",
